1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:03,610
(Raj:)where he says he got caught
using someone else's badge,

2
00:00:03,777 --> 00:00:06,257
(Raj:)and Sheldon was right,
he did get charged with petty theft.

3
00:00:06,413 --> 00:00:09,523
(Raj:)Guys, if I go to jail
dressed as the Human Torch,

4
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:11,253
(Raj:)that might send the wrong message.

5
00:00:15,288 --> 00:00:17,198
(Leonard:)Maybe this isn't a good idea.

6
00:00:17,357 --> 00:00:21,137
(Howard:)I can text the guy and tell him
we changed our minds.

7
00:00:22,429 --> 00:00:23,809
(Raj:)Do it.

8
00:00:23,964 --> 00:00:27,914
(Howard:)Okay. We're officially
not going to Comic-Con.

9
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:32,280
(Leonard:)Hold on.
We always do this.

10
00:00:32,639 --> 00:00:34,809
(Howard:)-Do what?
-Chicken out.

11
00:00:34,975 --> 00:00:36,475
(Leonard:)We're so afraid
of getting into trouble

12
00:00:36,643 --> 00:00:38,143
(Leonard:)that we never do anything wrong.

13
00:00:38,311 --> 00:00:39,651
(Raj:)That's 'cause we're the good guys.

14
00:00:39,813 --> 00:00:41,723
(Leonard:)Even Batman breaks the rules.

15
00:00:41,881 --> 00:00:43,591
(Raj:)You know I struggle with Batman.

16
00:00:45,752 --> 00:00:48,422
(Leonard:)I say, this one time,
instead of wimping out,

17
00:00:48,588 --> 00:00:50,568
let's be badasses!

18
00:00:51,658 --> 00:00:53,228
(Raj:)Okay, I'll be a badass.

19
00:00:53,393 --> 00:00:55,343
(Raj:)But only if you pinky-swear
to be one, too.

20
00:00:57,964 --> 00:00:59,274
(Leonard:)Howard, you in on this?

21
00:00:59,599 --> 00:01:03,019
(Howard:)No need.
I'm breaking rules all the time.

